This project works with the following third-party components. None of them
is included in this repository; they are obtained separately:

  * Bosch GTM SystemC model (Robert Bosch GmbH, COSEDA Technologies GmbH),
    free download from https://www.coseda-tech.com/bosch-gtm-systemc-model,
    provided by COSEDA under the Apache License 2.0
  * SystemC-AMS proof-of-concept (COSEDA Technologies GmbH), free download
    from https://www.coseda-tech.com/systemc-ams-proof-of-concept,
    Apache License 2.0
  * SystemC (Accellera Systems Initiative, Apache License 2.0), downloaded
    during the build
  * Windows only: a MinGW-w64 GCC toolchain, e.g. WinLibs

The example in examples/atom_somp/ is based on the ATOM SOMP example of the
Bosch GTM SystemC model (register configuration sequence, test bench
instance/signal names and stimulus values), which COSEDA Technologies GmbH
provides under the Apache License 2.0. It was rewritten for plain SystemC.

The runtime interface the prebuilt GTM libraries require from COSIDE (which
is not part of the model download) is implemented independently in
cos_compat/.

